
 Upakut / Manic

A creative web experience inspired by graffiti culture and independent streetwear from New Zealand.

About

Upakut is a clothing brand rooted in graffiti culture, while MANIC represents the artistic identity behind it.

This project is an ongoing exploration of visual storytelling, frontend development, and future full-stack e-commerce functionality.

Rather than building a generic online store, the goal is to create an immersive digital experience that reflects the personality of the brand.

